### 1. Query all existing option-groups + their options  查询所有 Options / Value ~~~~~~~ OK OK OK
POST http://192.168.0.53:3000/admin-api
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 5adfc212fa32fcfb1f2296a1afb9021adf209e94a47db382d999a63bb04b0369

{
    "query":"query AllOptionGroups { productOptionGroups { id code name options { id code name } } }"
}

### 1. Query all existing option-groups + their options  查询所有 Options / Value ~~~~~~~ OK OK OK

###

### 2. Create a new ProductOptionGroup with nested options 创建 Options / Value ~~~~~~~ OK OK OK OK

POST http://192.168.0.53:3000/admin-api
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 5adfc212fa32fcfb1f2296a1afb9021adf209e94a47db382d999a63bb04b0369

{ "query":"mutation CreateGroup($input: CreateProductOptionGroupInput!){ createProductOptionGroup(input:$input){ id code translations { languageCode name } options { id code translations { languageCode name } } } }", "variables":{ "input":{ "code":"laptop-hd-disk", "translations":[{ "languageCode":"en", "name":"Laptop HD Disk"}], "options":[ { "code":"512gb", "translations":[{ "languageCode":"en", "name":"512GB"}] }, { "code":"1tb", "translations":[{ "languageCode":"en", "name":"1TB"}] }, { "code":"2tb", "translations":[{ "languageCode":"en", "name":"2TB"}] } ] } } }

### 2. Create a new ProductOptionGroup with nested options 创建 Options / Value ~~~~~~~ OK OK OK OK

###

### 3. Attach the newly created group to a product  把 Option / 产品连接起来 ~~~~~~~~~~~ OK OK OK OK

POST http://192.168.0.53:3000/admin-api
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 5adfc212fa32fcfb1f2296a1afb9021adf209e94a47db382d999a63bb04b0369

{ "query":"mutation AttachGroup($productId: ID!, $optionGroupId: ID!){ addOptionGroupToProduct(productId:$productId, optionGroupId:$optionGroupId){ id optionGroups { id translations { languageCode name } } } }", "variables":{ "productId":"1", "optionGroupId":"18" } }


### 3. Attach the newly created group to a product  把 Option / 产品连接起来 ~~~~~~~~~~~ OK OK OK OK


