### 5. 修改某一个 Options Value ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~ OK OK OK OK

POST http://192.168.0.53:3000/admin-api
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 5adfc212fa32fcfb1f2296a1afb9021adf209e94a47db382d999a63bb04b0369

{
  "query": "mutation { updateProductOption(input: { id: \"49\", code: \"64-gb\", translations: [{ languageCode: en, name: \"64GB\" }] }) { id code translations { languageCode name } } }"
}


